  "body": "## ts-chef v0.8.1\n\n### Install Extension\n1. Download **`vscode-ts-chef-0.8.1.vsix`** from the assets below.\n2. In VS Code: **Extensions** (⇧⌘X) → **⋯** → **Install from VSIX…**\n\nOr via Command Line:\n```bash\ncode --install-extension vscode-ts-chef-0.8.1.vsix\n```\n\n### Documentation\n* Download **`ts-chef-docs-0.8.1.zip`** to view the full API documentation offline. Extract the archive and open `index.html` in your browser.\n\n---\n> ⚠️ Early development — bugs possible. Please [open an issue](../../issues/new) if something breaks.\n"
